# `sumif` of integers checks for overflow (DS4003).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize total = sumif(9000000000000000000, isnotnull(amount))
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `sumif` does not fit in a `long`
  --> query:2:21
  |
2 | | summarize total = sumif(9000000000000000000, isnotnull(amount))
  |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: a `long` holds whole numbers from -9223372036854775808 to 9223372036854775807
